                                id="text_RF0ZC57NS"
                                markdown="\0"
                                name="\0"
                                paragraphMode="false"
                                text="&lt;ul>&lt;li>&lt;p>Send event from inside an embed to outside components&lt;/p>&lt;ol>&lt;li>&lt;p>Open Item 2&lt;/p>&lt;ol>&lt;li>&lt;p>Button Click action event raises event, there is not internal handler so its sent to embed parent as a messages&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;p>Embed receives the message and find a matching Proxy event which has a config of `catchAll` and `unwrap`, it unwraps it and raise it as an event&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;p>Accordion on the right has event matching the topic or original event&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;/ol>&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;p>Open Item 3 sends a wrapped&lt;/p>&lt;ol>&lt;li>&lt;p>Button Click action event raises event, there is not internal handler so its sent to embed parent as a messages&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;p>Embed receives the message and find a matching Proxy event matching the emitted event by Topic, the event is wrapped as payload and send as a new event with new config.&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;p>Accordion on the right has event matching the topic for the new event and its config&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;/ol>&lt;/li>&lt;/ol>&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>"
                                theme="\0"/>
