                                markdown="\0"
                                name="\0"
                                paragraphMode="false"
                                text="&lt;ul>&lt;li>&lt;p>Send event from inside an embed to outside components&lt;/p>&lt;ol>&lt;li>&lt;p>Change to Page 2 / Change to Page 1&lt;/p>&lt;ol>&lt;li>&lt;p>Button Click action event raises event, there is not internal handler so its sent to embed parent as a messages&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;p>Embed receives the message and find a matching Proxy event, it wraps it and raises it as an event&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;li>&lt;p>The same embed has an event that matches the proxy topic, it receives the event, merges its config with its own config and executes the component action&lt;/p>&lt;/li>&lt;/ol>&lt;/li>&lt;/ol>&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>"/>
